 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- The tool registry validates calls against each tool's declared JSON Schema before invoking its executor. Invalid calls return a descriptive result to the model, including the failing property path and constraint without exposing the supplied value; extra properties pass through unchanged. **Migration note:** executors that hand-validated input now receive only input accepted by their declared schema, and tools that relied on receiving malformed input to produce their own error message will no longer see it.
+
